      {
        "id": 17538,
        "title": "Şablon Dizeleri",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenleri ve ifadeleri dizelerin içine eklemeyi kolaylaştıran JavaScript <strong>şablon dizeleri</strong> ile nasıl çalışacağını öğrenelim.</p><p>Aşağıda template literal'ların, kendilerinden üstteki daha uzun yöntemle aynı sonucu nasıl elde ettiğine göz at.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen the Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Welcome \" /><text value=\"${playerName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148786,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Şablon dizeleri, dize sabitleri aracılığıyla dizeleri değişkenlerle birleştirmeyi kolaylaştırır.</p><p><code>\"Sword\"</code> dizesini, <code>Sword</code> ifadesini çift tırnak yerine ters tırnak karakterleriyle çevreleyerek bir dize sabitine dönüştürelim.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = \" /><text value=\"`Sword`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loot);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>`</code>, ardından <code>Sword</code> ve son olarak <code>`</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenleri dize sabitleriyle kolayca birleştirmek için <code>${name}</code> söz dizimini kullanırız; burada <code>name</code> bir değişkendir.</p><p><code>${enemyType}</code> kodu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"`slime`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`A wild \" /><text value=\"${enemyType}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" appears!`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>$</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve sonra <code>enemyType</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148788,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>${}</code> içindeki süslü parantezlere ifadeler ekleyerek dize sabiti içinde de işlemler gerçekleştirebiliriz.</p><p><code>damage * multiplier</code> ifadesini ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" multiplier = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"`Total damage: \" /><text value=\"${damage * multiplier}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>damage</code>, ardından <code>*</code> ve son olarak <code>multiplier</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148789,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonu çağırırken, fonksiyona bağımsız değişken olarak bir dize sabiti geçiriyorsak parantezleri <code>()</code> yazmayız.</p><p><code>spawnPlayer</code> fonksiyonunu çağırırken <code>Jane</code> dize sabitini geçirelim.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(Jane)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnPlayer = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Spawning player: \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(spawnPlayer\" /><text value=\"`Jane`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>`Jane`</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizeyi dize sabitine nasıl dönüştürürüz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dizeyi ters tırnak karakterleri içine alarak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dizeyi çift tırnak içine alarak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dizeyi ters tırnak karakterleri içine alarak.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>June Jenny</code> ifadesini görüntülemesi amaçlanan aşağıdaki kodda sorun nedir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerTag = \" /><text value=\"`Jenny`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"`June $[playerTag]`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Köşeli parantezler <code>[]</code> yerine süslü parantezleri <code>{}</code> kullanmalıyız.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Köşeli parantez <code>[]</code> yerine normal parantez <code>()</code> kullanmalıyız</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Köşeli parantezler <code>[]</code> yerine süslü parantezleri <code>{}</code> kullanmalıyız..</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İfadeleri dize sabitleriyle nasıl birleştiririz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>${}</code> sözdiziminin süslü parantezlerinin içine ifadeler ekleriz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>${}</code> söz diziminde süslü parantezlerin arasına ifadeler ekleriz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>${}</code> sözdiziminin süslü parantezlerinin içine ifadeler ekleriz.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonu dize sabiti bağımsız değişkeniyle çağırırken neyi dışarıda bırakırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parantezler <code>()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Geri tırnaklar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parantezler <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Shield</code> öğe adını bir dize sabiti olarak ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"´Shield´\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"`Shield`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(item);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>`Shield`</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkisini tek bir dizede birleştirmek için ikinci dize sabitini kodla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"80\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stage1 = \" /><text value=\"`Forest`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stage2 = \" /><text value=\"`Castle`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stages = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${stage1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"${stage2}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(stages);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>${stage2}</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verilen toplam hasarı hesaplamak için kodu yaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" baseDamage = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hits = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"`Total damage: \" /><text value=\"${baseDamage * hits}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>$</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve sonra <code>*</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>pickedUpBy</code> fonksiyonunu çağır ve <code>Hellen</code> dize sabitini argüman olarak geçir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;Hellen&quot;)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickedUpBy = \" /><text value=\"person\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Loot picked up by: \" /><text value=\"${person}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickedUpBy\" /><text value=\"`Hellen`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>pickedUpBy</code>, ardından <code>`Hellen`</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
